      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحَمٌّ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُمْقُمَةٌ</span>: (Mgh, Msb;) i. e. <i>A vessel
of copper</i> [or <i>brass</i>], <i>in which water is heated,</i>
(KL, and Msb in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قم</span>,) <i>having a long and
narrow neck:</i> (KL:) or <i>a small</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُمْقُم</span> [here meaning the same as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُمْقُمَة</span>], <i>in which water is heated.</i>
(S.)

